@startuml Media Lifecycle Flow - Clubinho NIB API
!theme plain
hide footbox
title Media — upload, replace and compensation

participant "Owning feature service" as Owner
participant S3UploadTracker as Tracker
participant "AWS S3\nAwsS3Service" as S3
participant MediaItemProcessor as Processor
database "MySQL\nMediaItemRepository" as Repository

Owner -> Tracker : upload(file)
Tracker -> S3 : upload object
S3 --> Tracker : URL
Tracker --> Owner : URL recorded for compensation
Owner -> Processor : create or synchronize media metadata
Processor -> Repository : save/update media row for targetId + targetType
Repository --> Owner : MediaItemEntity

alt Replace or remove local media
  Owner -> Processor : delete old media after replacement is saved
  Processor -> S3 : delete old owned object
  Processor -> Repository : remove old row
else Owning operation fails
  Owner -> Processor : discardUnreferencedUploads(tracked URLs)
  Processor -> Repository : check whether each URL is referenced
  Processor -> S3 : delete only unreferenced uploads
end

note over Owner, Repository
  Upload happens before database confirmation; compensation prevents S3 orphans.
end note
@enduml
